<view class="wrap">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">服务器地址</view>
    <view class="hint">开发时填本机 http://127.0.0.1:8787（需在开发者工具勾选「不校验合法域名」）。真机调试改成电脑的局域网 IP（沙箱需以 --host 0.0.0.0 启动）。正式发布必须是已备案的 HTTPS 域名，并加入小程序后台「request 合法域名」。</view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">当前</text>
      <text class="field-value mono">{{baseUrl}}</text>
    </view>
    <input class="input mono" value="{{baseInput}}" bindinput="onBaseInput" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:8787" />
    <view class="row" style="margin-top:16rpx;">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-key="local" bindtap="pickPreset">本机</button>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-key="lan" bindtap="pickPreset">局域网</button>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-key="online" bindtap="pickPreset">线上</button>
    </view>
    <button class="btn" bindtap="saveBase" style="margin-top:16rpx;">保存地址</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">教师端 / 教室动态码设备</view>
    <view class="hint">模拟教室墙上会轮换的动态码。密钥由 run.bat 启动沙箱时打印（默认 TESTSEC1）。</view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">教室端密钥</text>
      <input class="input mono" value="{{secret}}" bindinput="onSecretInput" placeholder="如 TESTSEC1" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn" bindtap="connect">{{connected ? '重新连接' : '连接并开始轮换'}}</button>
    <view wx:if="{{err}}" class="fail" style="margin-top:16rpx;">{{err}}</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{connected}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">当前动态码</view>
      <view class="code-big">{{code}}</view>
      <view class="code-sub">{{secLeft}} 秒后自动轮换</view>
      <view class="hint" style="text-align:center;">学生端填这个码才能通过加固模式的「现场动态码」校验。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">服务端模式</view>
      <view class="row">
        <button class="btn {{mode === 'vulnerable' ? '' : 'btn-ghost'}}" data-mode="vulnerable" bindtap="switchMode">漏洞模式</button>
        <button class="btn {{mode === 'hardened' ? 'btn-danger' : 'btn-ghost'}}" data-mode="hardened" bindtap="switchMode">加固模式</button>
      </view>
      <view class="hint">当前：{{mode === 'hardened' ? '加固（身份/定位/动态码/相机/水印/去重逐项校验）' : '漏洞（明文信任客户端上报）'}}。只影响本机沙箱。</view>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="reset" style="margin-top:16rpx;">清空提交记录</button>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">提交记录（最近 20 条）</view>
      <view wx:if="{{rows.length === 0}}" class="hint">还没有提交记录。</view>
      <view class="sub-row" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="index">
        <view class="sub-head">
          <text class="mono">{{item.time}}</text>
          <text>{{item.name}} · {{item.sceneLabel}}</text>
          <text class="{{item.ok ? 'ok' : 'fail'}}">{{item.result}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="hint">{{item.flag}}{{item.flag && item.reasonText ? '；' : ''}}{{item.reasonText}}｜距目标 {{item.dist}}｜来源 {{item.src}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
